msgid ""
"Click a color to use it on all your LEDs. Your picks, for all zones or single zones, are "
"remembered for this image and come back when you return to it. A wallpaper you haven't picked for"
" follows its own colors."
msgstr ""
"Click a color to hoist it on all yer lanterns. Yer picks, fer the whole fleet or one strip, be "
"remembered fer this picture and come back when ye return to it. A wallpaper ye haven't picked fer"
" sails by its own colors."

msgid "Color correction preview"
msgstr "A peek at the color correction"

msgid "Your saved colors"
msgstr "Yer treasure chest o' colors"

msgid "Custom color…"
msgstr "A color o' yer own…"

