msgstr "Install Iridia {v}?"

msgid ""
"Your settings are backed up first, and the version you have now is kept so you can go back. The "
"LEDs pause for a few seconds while the daemon restarts, and this window restarts when it's done."
msgstr ""
"Yer settings be stowed first, an' the version ye have now be kept so ye can sail back. The "
"lanterns pause a few seconds while the daemon restarts, an' this window restarts when it be done."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating to {v}…"
msgstr "Updatin' to {v}…"

msgid "Update"
msgstr "Update"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Go back to Iridia {v}?"
msgstr "Sail back to Iridia {v}?"

msgid ""
"The version you have now is kept in its place, so you can switch again. Your settings stay as "
"they are."
msgstr ""
"The version ye have now be kept in its place, so ye can switch again. Yer settings stay as they "
"be."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Going back to {v}…"
msgstr "Sailin' back to {v}…"

