"The LEDs fade out over 2 seconds and come back in half a second. Try it shows the lock setting "
"(or off, if that's Keep) for 5 seconds."
msgstr ""
"The lanterns fade over 2 seconds an' come back in half a second. Try it shows the lock settin' "
"(or dark, if that be Hold fast) fer 5 seconds."

msgid "Idle time can't be seen here: lines for hypridle or swayidle"
msgstr "Can't see idle time on this ship: lines fer hypridle or swayidle"

msgid ""
"Add these to your idle daemon's config, and Iridia knows when you're away (it then uses that "
"daemon's timeout instead of the minutes above)."
msgstr ""
"Add these to yer idle daemon's config, an' Iridia knows when ye've gone ashore (it then uses that"
" daemon's timeout instead o' the minutes above)."

