"Long 5V strips at full white drink a lot o' current: the far end turns orange or pink, or the "
"controller goes overboard. Set yer power supply's amps (minus a bit) an' Iridia dims only when a "
"color would go over. The guess assumes 60 mA per lantern at full white."

